# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your key. Never commit `.env.local`.
#
# This key is a DEV-ONLY convenience: it's used only by `npm run dev` so the
# simulator works without typing a key. Production builds (the packed .ehpk)
# ignore it — every user enters their OWN Soniox key in the app's Settings on
# their phone, so they're billed for their own usage.
#
# Everything else (target language, "don't translate" languages, full-screen
# vs split, sentence splitting, speaker labels) is configured IN-APP in
# Settings — there are no env vars for those.
VITE_STT_API_KEY=
